urants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Hs-jwE791t3cX9ErgTcEFg","review_id":"XRdQ_G99OQ1PmtxzrEbREg","date":"2011-03-25T03:06:59","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9252841472625732,"text_excerpt":"What a sweet, sweet place! I love the idea of a \"family friendly\" coffee shop - even if you don't have kids, this is just a totally charming, unpretentious place to come get a coffee or a sno-cone, and the owner is lovely. Can't go wrong. It's also directly across the street from Surrey's, a great brunch spot."},{"business_id":"Hs-jwE791t3cX9ErgTcEFg","review_id":"MI0aTdrExhUVAQG1XFbp0g","date":"2016-05-21T19:42:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9221038818359375,"text_excerpt":"This place is a real neighborhood gem. The owner really cares about everyone having a great time when they're visiting. It can get loud in the afternoon with all the neighborhood kids running in but it just shows how much the shop is beloved. Try the affogato - it's wonderful - as are all the other coffee options. It's even a great spot to grab a snowball on a hot day."},{"business_id":"Hs-jwE791t3cX9ErgTcEFg","review_id":"0NSGoqBVWk6XAmwQLceMoQ","date":"2013-12-03T08:18:30","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9203124046325684,"text_excerpt":"How cute this place is! Right when you walk in, it feels like home. The whole place is decorated set up like a living room type area. With board games on a book shelf to the side, and the corner there is a piano. This makes sense since the coffee shop is located next door to an elementary school. This place also serves Popsicles, snoballs, pastries, and a lot of other snacks. I love how the whole atmosphere in the place is very kid friendly and it felt like you were at home. Great local place to hit up for iced/hot coffee and sweet indulgences ."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Hs-jwE791t3cX9ErgTcEFg","photo_id":"LVnai0OK0RPUUnwbGrELoQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/LVnai0OK0RPUUnwbGrELoQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
